  "authority": "Typed-source audit and implementation only; no new native analysis or runtime observation.",
  "finding": "Selected OwnedEngine already gates post-cleanup closure on actual engine empty plus external proof. It separately requires trampoline users drained before uninitialize; existing post-cleanup proof did not supply that earlier prerequisite.",
  "production_dependency": "Both loader hooks: external native entry/trampoline users must drain before source exit cleanup can unload library/online/hook code.",
  "implementation": [
    "New independent CallbackCleanupPrerequisite leaves existing CallbackAttachment virtual slots unchanged. SourceBackend stop_and_join invokes it after actual native joins, source route drain and Worker.finish, before ClosingBackend can drain source exit callbacks.",
    "install_host now requires a separate real pre_cleanup_quiescence callback. Matched attachment owns it by swap, checks delegate admission/native leases before and after opaque proof, preserves LastError, and treats true as a durable external exclusion promise through attachment closure.",
    "Known false retains stopped/joined roots, native binding and providers before library/online/hook cleanup. Controller retry repeats proof without rerunning source stopper or a completed Worker.finish. True is memoized; unknown proof outcomes or swallowed wrapper reentry poison retention.",
    "Never-published attachment retains existing unpublished-close behavior without calling external proof. Later engine-empty + external_quiescence and actual native Binding.close remain separate mandatory checks.",
    "No external exclusion proof is manufactured from body counters, Stop receipts, tokens or code owners. The actual production host pre/post proofs and per-image assembly remain unimplemented."
  ],
  "source_scenarios_added": "Existing full owning Runtime/Resources controlled SDK fixture rejects missing pre-proof before consumption; two false pre-proof retries with a true post-proof perform no source library/object/hook cleanup; then true permits existing failed-uninitialize/engine-repair/post-proof retry route. Not compiled or executed.",
  "layout": "AssemblyInputs gains a function field; rebuild all allocating/passing consumers when explicitly authorized. Existing CallbackAttachment vtable is unchanged; the private matched adapter adds a secondary interface.",
